ed 2026-09-05 [E083]. Not a court date.\n\nOpen issue: the client has been trying to move it earlier and it hasn't been resolved.\n- He asked to change it to Wednesday 9/9 and sought confirmation [E176]; also raised it in live chat [E181] and by SMS [E179].\n- On 2026-09-08 he confirmed he received no confirmation email and still sees 10/2 on his end [E187].\n- The paralegal replied the same day that it was escalated to the team [E189]. No later event in the record shows the date being changed."}
